{"unit_id":"Enderfga__dsh-clawo#card-zh","repo":"Enderfga/dsh-clawo","commit":"ba8e5a804c81b2f83219b467dbcc0097f2145bd5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-clawo 是一款 DSH 插件包，通过补丁把 DeepSeek Harness 自带的 ACP 子代理客户端配置为 Claw Orchestrator 提供方，并以 clawo 名称注册。它使用 npx 启动 Claw Orchestrator 的 ACP 命令，让 DSH 子代理请求交给主机上已认证的编码 CLI 运行；README 介绍了单引擎回答、多引擎 council、长程规划和并行审查等模式。适合希望在 DSH 中委派编码任务、组织多引擎协作的开发者。安装需要支持 bundle patch 的 DSH 和 Node.js，且主机需配置要调用的编码 CLI。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:10-16","README.md:27-48"]}
{"unit_id":"Enderfga__dsh-clawo#card-en","repo":"Enderfga/dsh-clawo","commit":"ba8e5a804c81b2f83219b467dbcc0097f2145bd5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-clawo registers Claw Orchestrator as a DSH ACP subagent provider. Its patch launches the orchestrator through npx to handle delegated work with host coding CLIs. The README describes single-engine, council, planning, and parallel review modes. It requires Node.js, compatible DSH, and CLIs.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:10-16","README.md:27-48"]}
